Yes - in ADOM, pets will not pick up objects and so cannot be used to
rob shops.  The only absolutely safe way to rob a shop is to be
invisible, but the shopkeeper will notice you after a while and you
will never again be able to steal anything more from that shop.

High-level Thieves have the special ability to steal items from shops,
but this has a chance of failing and angering the shopkeeper.

All other methods (e.g. teleporting yourself or the shopkeeper) result
in an angry shopkeeper and hordes of summoned thugs and are bad for
your karma.
